      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been tracking some of my baseline stats lately and honestly the data looks weird. i only need like 3-4 hours of sleep to feel completely sharp, like my brain is actually running faster than usual. also i can process complex technical info way faster than my peers—it’s like i don't even have to 'try' to understand, it just clicks instantly. i also feel like i'm operating on a different frequency or something, just a sense of heightened awareness. are there actually documented cases of enhanced human models or people who are just biologically optimized differently than the standard population?",
